# imcdatasets 1.21.3

+ Added the `SteenbuckDamond_2026_T1D` dataset.

# imcdatasets 1.21.2

* Datasets are now stored on Zenodo instead of the Bioconductor AWS lake.
* Added the `Meyer_2025_TripleNegativeBreastCancer` dataset.

# imcdatasets 1.11.1

* Removed defunct functions.

# imcdatasets 1.7.3

* Added the `HochSchulz_2022_Melanoma` dataset.

# imcdatasets 1.7.2

* Added the `IMMUcan_2022_CancerExample` dataset.
* Used the `IMMUcan_2022_CancerExample` dataset in the vignette.

# imcdatasets 1.7.1

* Added the full dataset (masks and single-cell data) for `JacksonFischer_2020_BreastCancer`.
* Added the "Zurich" cohort for the `JacksonFischt.
* Added full datasets (masks and single-cell data) for the `Damond_2019_Pancreas` dataset.
* Made deprecated functions (`DamondPancreas2019Da`, and `ZanotelliSpheroids2020Data`) defunct.

# imcdatasets 1.5.4

* Added the possibility to retrieve single cell data in the SpatialExperiment format.

# imcdatasets 1.5.3

* Updated all datasets to have consistent object formatting.
* Added dataset versioning.
* Added new dataset-loading functions and deprecated the old ones.
* Added a new vignette with guidelines for contribution and dataset formatting.

# imcdatasets 1.5.2

* Updated wrapper functions.
* Updated test functions.
* Updated biocViews and documentation.
* Added a `LICENSE` file.

# imcdatasets 1.4.1

* Added a deprecation note for `.onLoad` functio

# imcdatasets 1.1.1

* Added documentation (dataset list in `README`,es).

# imcdatasets 1.0.0

* First release version in Bioconductor.

